# GitHub Actions workflows cannot be pushed by a token without the `workflow` OAuth scope.
# The workflow lives at .github/workflows-pending/ci.yml until the scope is granted — see the
# README there. Ignored so `git add -A` can't reintroduce the rejected push.
.github/workflows/
